### **Genesis 22:8 (LXX):**\
*"\uc0\u949 \u7990 \u960 \u949 \u957  \u948 \u8050  \u7944 \u946 \u961 \u945 \u940 \u956  \u8009  \u920 \u949 \u8056 \u962  \u8004 \u968 \u949 \u964 \u945 \u953  \u7953 \u945 \u965 \u964 \u8183  \u960 \u961 \u972 \u946 \u945 \u964 \u959 \u957  \u949 \u7984 \u962  \u8001 \u955 \u959 \u954 \u940 \u961 \u960 \u969 \u963 \u953 \u957 , \u964 \u941 \u954 \u957 \u959 \u957 . \u960 \u959 \u961 \u949 \u965 \u952 \u941 \u957 \u964 \u949 \u962  \u948 \u8050  \u7936 \u956 \u966 \u972 \u964 \u949 \u961 \u959 \u953  \u7941 \u956 \u945 "*\
