\
### Observations\
\
**(1) The Father-Son typology is unmistakable:**\
- A father offering his **beloved only son** (**\uc0\u964 \u8056 \u957  \u965 \u7985 \u972 \u957  \u963 \u959 \u965  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u7936 \u947 \u945 \u960 \u951 \u964 \u972 \u957 **).\
