- The son **carries the wood of his own sacrifice** (v. 6) \'97 as Christ carried His own cross.\
- The father declares **"God will provide for Himself the lamb"** \'97 the very title John the Baptist will give Jesus: **"\uc0\u7988 \u948 \u949  \u8001  \u7936 \u956 \u957 \u8056 \u962  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u920 \u949 \u959 \u8166 "** (John 1:29).\
\
**(2) The two witnesses confirming Genesis 22 as a posit of the Son:**\
