### **Psalm 2:6-7 (LXX):**\
*"\uc0\u7960 \u947 \u8060  \u948 \u8050  \u954 \u945 \u964 \u949 \u963 \u964 \u940 \u952 \u951 \u957  \u946 \u945 \u963 \u953 \u955 \u949 \u8058 \u962  \u8017 \u960 \u8125  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u7952 \u960 \u8054  \u931 \u953 \u8060 \u957  \u8004 \u961 \u959 \u962  \u964 \u8056  \u7941 \u947 \u953 \u959 \u957  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u948 \u953 \u945 \u947 \u947 \u941 \u955 \u955 \u969 \u957  \u964 \u8056  \u960 \u961 \u972 \u963 \u964 \u945 \u947 \u956 \u945  \u922 \u965 \u961 \u943 \u959 \u965 . \u922 \u973 \u961 \u953 \u959 \u962  \u949 \u7990 \u960 \u949 \u957  \u960 \u961 \u972 \u962  \u956 \u949  \u933 \u7985 \u972 \u962  \u956 \u959 \u965  \u949 \u7990  \u963 \u973 , \u7952 \u947 \u8060  \u963 \u942 \u956 \u949 \u961 \u959 \u957  \u947 \u949 \u947 \u941 \u957 \u957 \u951 \u954 \u940  \u963 \u949 ."*\
