**1599 Geneva:**\
*"For David is not ascended into heaven, but he saith, The Lord said to my Lord, Sit at my right hand, Until I make thine enemies thy footstool. Therefore, let all the house of Israel know for a surety, that God hath made him both Lord and Christ, this Jesus, I say, whom ye have crucified."*\
