### **Psalm 109:3 LXX (110:3 MT):**\
*"\uc0\u956 \u949 \u964 \u8048  \u963 \u959 \u8166  \u7969  \u7936 \u961 \u967 \u8052  \u7952 \u957  \u7969 \u956 \u941 \u961 \u8115  \u964 \u8134 \u962  \u948 \u965 \u957 \u940 \u956 \u949 \u974 \u962  \u963 \u959 \u965  \u7952 \u957  \u964 \u945 \u8150 \u962  \u955 \u945 \u956 \u960 \u961 \u972 \u964 \u951 \u963 \u953 \u957  \u964 \u8182 \u957  \u7937 \u947 \u943 \u969 \u957 \'b7 \u7952 \u954  \u947 \u945 \u963 \u964 \u961 \u8056 \u962  \u960 \u961 \u8056  \u7953 \u969 \u963 \u966 \u972 \u961 \u959 \u965  \u7952 \u947 \u941 \u957 \u957 \u951 \u963 \u940  \u963 \u949 ."*\
