### **Psalm 109:4 LXX (110:4 MT):**\
*"\uc0\u8036 \u956 \u959 \u963 \u949 \u957  \u922 \u973 \u961 \u953 \u959 \u962  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u959 \u8016  \u956 \u949 \u964 \u945 \u956 \u949 \u955 \u951 \u952 \u942 \u963 \u949 \u964 \u945 \u953 \'b7 \u931 \u8058  \u7985 \u949 \u961 \u949 \u8058 \u962  \u949 \u7984 \u962  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u945 \u7984 \u8182 \u957 \u945  \u954 \u945 \u964 \u8048  \u964 \u8052 \u957  \u964 \u940 \u958 \u953 \u957  \u924 \u949 \u955 \u967 \u953 \u963 \u949 \u948 \u941 \u954 ."*\
\
### **1599 Geneva:**\
*"The Lord sware and will not repent, Thou art a Priest forever after the order of Melchi-zedek."*\
