### Observation\
\
The Father swears an oath that the Son shall be **\uc0\u7985 \u949 \u961 \u949 \u8058 \u962  \u949 \u7984 \u962  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u945 \u7984 \u8182 \u957 \u945 ** \'97 *Priest forever* \'97 after the order of Melchizedek (Gen 14). The Son is not only **King** at the right hand (vv. 1-3) \'97 He is also **Priest** by the Father's appointment.\
