**1599 Geneva:**\
*"So likewise Christ took not to himself this honor, to be made the high Priest, but he that said unto him, Thou art my Son, this day begat I thee, gave it him. As he also in another place speaketh, Thou art a Priest forever, after the order of Melchi-zedek."*\
