The author of Hebrews binds Psalm 2:7 and Psalm 110:4 together \'97 the Son does **not glorify Himself**; the Father glorifies Him with both Sonship and Priesthood. **The Son receives every office He holds *from* the Father.**\
\
**Witness #2 \'97 Hebrews 7:21:**\
