### Observations\
\
**(1)** **\uc0\u963 \u965 \u956 \u960 \u945 \u961 \u942 \u956 \u951 \u957  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u8183 ** \'97 *"I was present alongside Him."* Wisdom is **with** the Lord at the creation. This is precisely the language John 1:1 will echo: **\u8001  \u923 \u972 \u947 \u959 \u962  \u7974 \u957  \u960 \u961 \u8056 \u962  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u920 \u949 \u972 \u957 ** \'97 *"the Word was with God."*\
