### What Micah 5:2 adds to our portrait of the Son:\
\
1. He is to be born in **Bethlehem** \'97 a definite, prophesied earthly location.\
2. He is a **Ruler** for Israel \'97 given by the Father, **for** the Father (**\uc0\u956 \u959 \u953 **).\
3. His **goings-forth** (plural) extend back **from days of old / of the age** \'97 He has a prior history before His birth in Bethlehem.\
\
