### Observation of decisive importance\
\
The Messenger says: **"I will multiply your seed."** This is a promise that **only God can make and fulfill** \'97 and it is the **same promise** the LORD Himself makes directly to Abraham (Gen 13:16; 15:5; 22:17). The Messenger does not say *"The LORD will multiply"*; He says **"I will multiply."** He speaks in the first person *as God*.\
