**LXX:**\
*"\uc0\u954 \u945 \u8054  \u7952 \u954 \u940 \u955 \u949 \u963 \u949 \u957  \u7945 \u947 \u8048 \u961  \u964 \u8056  \u8004 \u957 \u959 \u956 \u945  \u922 \u965 \u961 \u943 \u959 \u965  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u955 \u945 \u955 \u959 \u8166 \u957 \u964 \u959 \u962  \u960 \u961 \u8056 \u962  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u942 \u957 \'b7 \u931 \u8058  \u8001  \u920 \u949 \u8056 \u962  \u8001  \u7952 \u960 \u953 \u948 \u974 \u957  \u956 \u949 \'b7 \u8005 \u964 \u953  \u949 \u7990 \u960 \u949 \u957 \'b7 \u922 \u945 \u8054  \u947 \u8048 \u961  \u7952 \u957 \u974 \u960 \u953 \u959 \u957  \u949 \u7990 \u948 \u959 \u957  \u8000 \u966 \u952 \u941 \u957 \u964 \u945  \u956 \u959 \u953 ."*\
