### Observation of the utmost weight\
\
Hagar identifies the Messenger as **\uc0\u922 \u973 \u961 \u953 \u959 \u962 ** \'97 *the LORD* \'97 and addresses Him as **\u931 \u8058  \u8001  \u920 \u949 \u8056 \u962 ** \'97 *"You are the God."* Furthermore, she marvels that she has **seen** Him and lived: **\u7952 \u957 \u974 \u960 \u953 \u959 \u957  \u949 \u7990 \u948 \u959 \u957  \u8000 \u966 \u952 \u941 \u957 \u964 \u945  \u956 \u959 \u953 ** \'97 *"I have seen face-to-face the One who appeared to me."*\
