- The Father is **invisible, unbegotten, the Source** \'97 the One God of the Shema (Deut 6:4; Isa 44-46; John 17:3; 1 Cor 8:6).\
- The Son is **visible, begotten, the Sent One** \'97 Wisdom (Prov 8), Messenger (Gen-Ex), Word (John 1), Image (Col 1:15), Lamb (Gen 22 \uc0\u8594  John 1:29), Christ (Ps 2 \u8594  Acts 2:36).\
- **No man has ever seen the Father.** Every Old Testament theophany is a going-forth of the Son.\
- The Son carries the Father's Name, speaks the Father's words, and at every point acts **for** and **from** the Father \'97 never independently, never as a rival, never as "another God."\
