- **The Greeks seek wisdom** (\uc0\u963 \u959 \u966 \u943 \u945 \u957  \u950 \u951 \u964 \u959 \u8166 \u963 \u953 \u957 ) \'97 *their* wisdom, the world's wisdom.\
