The phrase **\uc0\u920 \u949 \u959 \u8166  \u963 \u959 \u966 \u943 \u945 \u957 ** is a **genitive of source/possession**: ***God's*** **wisdom** \'97 wisdom **belonging to the Father**, manifested **in** the crucified Christ. It is not saying "Christ is a personified pre-existent Wisdom-being." It is saying: **the Father's wisdom is displayed in what He has done through His Son's cross.**\
