- **John 17:3** \'97 Jesus addresses the Father as **\uc0\u964 \u8056 \u957  \u956 \u972 \u957 \u959 \u957  \u7936 \u955 \u951 \u952 \u953 \u957 \u8056 \u957  \u920 \u949 \u8056 \u957 ** \'97 *"the only true God."* \u10003 \
- **1 Cor 8:6** \'97 *"to us there is one God, the Father... and one Lord, Jesus Christ."* \uc0\u10003 \
- **John 20:17** \'97 Jesus calls the Father **\uc0\u920 \u949 \u972 \u957  \u956 \u959 \u965 ** \'97 *"My God."* \u10003 \
- **Eph 1:17** \'97 Paul speaks of *"the God of our Lord Jesus Christ, the Father of glory."* \uc0\u10003 \
- **Isaiah 44-46** \'97 repeated first-person declarations by the One God: *"besides Me there is no God."* \uc0\u10003 \
\
**Status: SOLIDLY ESTABLISHED.** Multiple direct, explicit witnesses, both OT and NT, both from God's own mouth and from Jesus' own lips. No inference required.\
