### Claim C: Genesis 49:10 prophesies the Ruler from Judah, expectation of the nations.\
\
**Direct evidence:**\
- **Gen 49:10 LXX** \'97 the text plainly says what I quoted. \uc0\u10003 \
- **Rev 5:5** \'97 *"the Lion of the tribe of Judah"* echoes the Judah imagery. \uc0\u10003 \
- **Haggai 2:7** \'97 *"the desire of all nations shall come"* \'97 thematic parallel. \uc0\u10003 \
