### **Greek (the older and best-attested reading):**\
*"\uc0\u920 \u949 \u8056 \u957  \u959 \u8016 \u948 \u949 \u8054 \u962  \u7953 \u974 \u961 \u945 \u954 \u949 \u957  \u960 \u974 \u960 \u959 \u964 \u949 \'b7 \u956 \u959 \u957 \u959 \u947 \u949 \u957 \u8052 \u962  \u920 \u949 \u8056 \u962  \u8001  \u8034 \u957  \u949 \u7984 \u962  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u954 \u972 \u955 \u960 \u959 \u957  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u928 \u945 \u964 \u961 \u8056 \u962  \u7952 \u954 \u949 \u8150 \u957 \u959 \u962  \u7952 \u958 \u951 \u947 \u942 \u963 \u945 \u964 \u959 ."*\
