### Observations\
\
**(1)** **\uc0\u7952 \u957  \u956 \u959 \u961 \u966 \u8135  \u920 \u949 \u959 \u8166  \u8017 \u960 \u940 \u961 \u967 \u969 \u957 ** \'97 *"existing in the form of God."* **\u956 \u959 \u961 \u966 \u942 ** = form, outward expression of essential nature. **\u8017 \u960 \u940 \u961 \u967 \u969 \u957 ** = continuously existing, subsisting.\
