## **Psalm 21:16 LXX (22:16 MT) \'97 The Piercing of Hands and Feet**\
\
### **LXX:**\
*"\uc0\u8005 \u964 \u953  \u7952 \u954 \u973 \u954 \u955 \u969 \u963 \u940 \u957  \u956 \u949  \u954 \u973 \u957 \u949 \u962  \u960 \u959 \u955 \u955 \u959 \u943 , \u963 \u965 \u957 \u945 \u947 \u969 \u947 \u8052  \u960 \u959 \u957 \u951 \u961 \u949 \u965 \u959 \u956 \u941 \u957 \u969 \u957  \u960 \u949 \u961 \u953 \u941 \u963 \u967 \u959 \u957  \u956 \u949 , \u8036 \u961 \u965 \u958 \u945 \u957  \u967 \u949 \u8150 \u961 \u940 \u962  \u956 \u959 \u965  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u960 \u972 \u948 \u945 \u962 ."*\
\
