\
Our study of the Person of Christ has now covered:\
\
1. **The One God, the Father** \'97 Shema and Isa 44-46. \uc0\u10003 \
2. **The Son's pre-temporal glory and love with the Father** \'97 John 17:5, 24; Phil 2:6; Heb 1:3. \uc0\u10003 \
3. **The Father created all things through the Son** \'97 1 Cor 8:6; Col 1:16; Heb 1:2; John 1:3. \uc0\u10003 \
4. **The Son's coming in flesh, born of a woman** \'97 Gen 3:15; Isa 7:14; Gal 4:4; Mic 5:2. \uc0\u10003 \
5. **The Son as the Father's Anointed Christ, His King at the right hand** \'97 Ps 2; Ps 110; Matt 22; Acts 2; Heb 1, 5, 7. \uc0\u10003 \
6. **The Son's suffering, death, burial, and vindication as the Servant of the LORD** \'97 Ps 22; Isa 53; Gospels; 1 Peter; Romans; Hebrews; Acts. \uc0\u10003 \
\
The arc is becoming complete: from the Father's pre-temporal love of His Son, through the goings-forth and incarnation, through the suffering and substitutionary death, to the resurrection vindication and exalted enthronement at the Father's right hand.\
