**Honest assessment:** The absolute **\uc0\u7952 \u947 \u974  \u949 \u7984 \u956 \u953 ** sayings are *strong* witnesses to Jesus' divine self-disclosure \'97 bearing the Name and voice of the LORD. They are not, however, declarations *"I am the LORD"* or *"I am the Father."* They are claims to bear the LORD's self-identifying speech \'97 consistent with His being the One in whom **the Name dwells** (cf. Ex 23:21; John 17:11).\
