*"...the chief Priest answered, and said to him, I charge thee swear unto us by the living God, to tell us, If thou be that Christ the Son of God, or no. Jesus said to him, Thou hast said it: nevertheless I say unto you, hereafter shall ye see that Son of man, sitting at the right hand of the power of God, and come in the clouds of the heaven."*\
