### Observation of foundational importance\
\
This is Jesus' own clear statement of the Father-Son order:\
- **The Father has committed all judgment to the Son** (**\uc0\u948 \u941 \u948 \u969 \u954 \u949 \u957 **).\
- The Father **has given the Son** to have life in Himself.\
- The Father has **given** Him authority to judge.\
\
**Three times the Father is the Giver; the Son is the Receiver.** This is the consistent biblical pattern, and Jesus Himself articulates it.\
\
But notice also: **"that all men should honor the Son as they honor the Father."** The Son is to receive **equal honor** to the Father \'97 *because* the Father has so willed it. The honor given to the Son flows to the Father (Phil 2:11 \'97 *"to the glory of God the Father"*).\
