# **GRAND SYNTHESIS \'97 What His Ministry Establishes**\
\
Through the acts and words of His ministry, the following are established by the most extensive direct evidence:\
\
### **About His Person:**\
\
1. **He is the prophesied Servant of the LORD** \'97 by His own citation of Isaiah 61 (Luke 4:17-21).\
2. **He is the Son of Man of Daniel 7** \'97 by His own claim before the high priest (Matt 26:64).\
3. **He is the Christ, the Son of God** \'97 by His own confession (Matt 26:64; John 4:25-26).\
4. **He bears the LORD's voice** \'97 the **\uc0\u7952 \u947 \u974  \u949 \u7984 \u956 \u953 ** sayings.\
5. **He is greater than Solomon, Jonah, and the temple** \'97 by His own testimony.\
6. **He is the embodiment of the LORD's prophesied works** \'97 His miracles fulfill Isaiah 35, 53, 61.\
\
### **About His Authority:**\
\
7. **He forgives sins** \'97 exercised on earth as the Son of Man.\
8. **He commands nature.**\
9. **He raises the dead.**\
10. **He has been given all judgment.**\
11. **He gives the Holy Spirit** \'97 having received it from the Father.\
12. **He has been given all authority** \'97 explicitly **given**, not innately possessed apart from the Father.\
\
### **About His Relation to the Father (His Own Words):**\
\
13. **He can do nothing of Himself** \'97 only what He sees the Father doing.\
14. **He does not seek His own will** \'97 but the Father's.\
15. **He speaks what the Father has taught Him.**\
16. **The Father is greater than Him.**\
17. **The Father alone is the only true God; the Son is the Sent One.**\
18. **The Son does not know what the Father knows** (the day and hour).\
\
### **About His Mission:**\
\
19. **He came to fulfill, not destroy** the Law and Prophets (Matt 5:17).\
20. **He came not to be served, but to serve, and to give His life a ransom for many** (Mark 10:45 \'97 echoing Isa 53).\
21. **He came to seek and save the lost** (Luke 19:10).\
22. **He came that they might have life, and have it abundantly** (John 10:10).\
\
### **Post-Resurrection:**\
\
23. **He is risen bodily** \'97 bearing His pierced hands and feet (fulfilling Ps 22:16).\
24. **He receives all authority from the Father** after resurrection.\
25. **He commissions worldwide proclamation.**\
26. **He ascends and is enthroned** at the Father's right hand (fulfilling Ps 110:1).\
27. **He will return in like manner** as He ascended.\
\
