  \u964 \u8134 \u962  \u8001 \u961 \u954 \u969 \u956 \u959 \u963 \u943 \u945 \u962  \u964 \u8134 \u962  \u956 \u949 \u964 \u8048  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u957 \u972 \u956 \u959 \u957  \u933 \u7985 \u8056 \u957  \u949 \u7984 \u962  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u945 \u7984 \u8182 \u957 \u945  \u964 \u949 \u964 \u949 \u955 \u949 \u953 \u969 \u956 \u941 \u957 \u959 \u957 ."*\
