**(1)** **\uc0\u7952 \u954 \u940 \u952 \u953 \u963 \u949 \u957  \u7952 \u957  \u948 \u949 \u958 \u953 \u8119  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u952 \u961 \u972 \u957 \u959 \u965  \u964 \u8134 \u962  \u956 \u949 \u947 \u945 \u955 \u969 \u963 \u973 \u957 \u951 \u962 ** \'97 *"He sat down at the right hand of the throne of the Majesty"* \'97 fulfilling Psalm 110:1.\
