### **1599 Geneva (Jer 31:31-34):**\
*"Behold, the days come, saith the Lord, that I will make a new covenant with the house of Israel, and with the house of Judah... I will put my Law in their inward parts, and write it in their hearts, and will be their God, and they shall be my people... For I will forgive their iniquity, and will remember their sins no more."*\
