### Cross-witness \'97 1 Timothy 2:5 (Greek):\
*"\uc0\u949 \u7991 \u962  \u947 \u8048 \u961  \u920 \u949 \u972 \u962 , \u949 \u7991 \u962  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u956 \u949 \u963 \u943 \u964 \u951 \u962  \u920 \u949 \u959 \u8166  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u7936 \u957 \u952 \u961 \u974 \u960 \u969 \u957 , \u7940 \u957 \u952 \u961 \u969 \u960 \u959 \u962  \u935 \u961 \u953 \u963 \u964 \u8056 \u962  \u7992 \u951 \u963 \u959 \u8166 \u962 ,"*\
