### Observations of decisive importance for the Son's present ministry\
\
**(1)** **\uc0\u949 \u7984 \u962  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u959 \u8016 \u961 \u945 \u957 \u972 \u957 ** \'97 *"into heaven itself."* The Son entered the **real heaven** \'97 not a copy. His ministry is in heaven now.\
\
**(2)** **\uc0\u957 \u8166 \u957  \u7952 \u956 \u966 \u945 \u957 \u953 \u963 \u952 \u8134 \u957 \u945 \u953  \u964 \u8183  \u960 \u961 \u959 \u963 \u974 \u960 \u8179  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u920 \u949 \u959 \u8166  \u8017 \u960 \u8050 \u961  \u7969 \u956 \u8182 \u957 ** \'97 *"NOW to appear before the face of God for us."*\
\
This is the **single most concise statement of the Son's present ministry:**\
- **\uc0\u957 \u8166 \u957 ** \'97 *now* \'97 at this very moment.\
- **\uc0\u7952 \u956 \u966 \u945 \u957 \u953 \u963 \u952 \u8134 \u957 \u945 \u953 ** \'97 *to appear, to be manifest.*\
- **\uc0\u964 \u8183  \u960 \u961 \u959 \u963 \u974 \u960 \u8179  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u920 \u949 \u959 \u8166 ** \'97 *before the face of God [the Father].*\
- **\uc0\u8017 \u960 \u8050 \u961  \u7969 \u956 \u8182 \u957 ** \'97 *on our behalf.*\
\
**The Son is, right now, appearing before the Father's face on our behalf.** This is the present, ongoing reality of His high-priestly ministry. He stands as the Man Christ Jesus before the Father, presenting His finished sacrifice and interceding for those who come to the Father through Him.\
\
**(3)** **\uc0\u7941 \u960 \u945 \u958  \u960 \u961 \u959 \u963 \u949 \u957 \u949 \u967 \u952 \u949 \u8054 \u962  \u949 \u7984 \u962  \u964 \u8056  \u960 \u959 \u955 \u955 \u8182 \u957  \u7936 \u957 \u949 \u957 \u949 \u947 \u954 \u949 \u8150 \u957  \u7937 \u956 \u945 \u961 \u964 \u943 \u945 \u962 ** \'97 *"having been offered once for all to bear the sins of many."* Direct echo of Isaiah 53:12. Once-for-all.\
\
**(4)** **\uc0\u7952 \u954  \u948 \u949 \u965 \u964 \u941 \u961 \u959 \u965  \u967 \u969 \u961 \u8054 \u962  \u7937 \u956 \u945 \u961 \u964 \u943 \u945 \u962  \u8000 \u966 \u952 \u942 \u963 \u949 \u964 \u945 \u953 ** \'97 *"He shall appear a second time, without sin."* His **second appearing** is foretold here \'97 **without sin** (because sin was dealt with at the first appearing) \'97 **\u949 \u7984 \u962  \u963 \u969 \u964 \u951 \u961 \u943 \u945 \u957 ** \'97 *unto salvation* \'97 for those who eagerly await Him.\
\
This is the framework for our future treatment of His return.\
