### **1599 Geneva (Dan 7:13-14):**\
*"As I beheld in visions by night, behold, one like the Son of man came in the clouds of heaven, and approached unto the Ancient of days, and they brought him before him. And he gave him dominion, and honor, and a kingdom, that all people, nations, and languages should serve him: his dominion is an everlasting dominion, which shall never be taken away: and his kingdom shall never be destroyed."*\
