**\uc0\u960 \u945 \u961 \u959 \u965 \u963 \u943 \u945 ** \'97 *parousia* \'97 is the technical term for the Son's coming. It means *"presence,"* *"arrival,"* *"royal visitation."* It is used throughout the NT for His return.\
