## **Matthew 24:36 \'97 Only the Father Knows**\
\
### **Greek:**\
*"\uc0\u928 \u949 \u961 \u8054  \u948 \u8050  \u964 \u8134 \u962  \u7969 \u956 \u941 \u961 \u945 \u962  \u7952 \u954 \u949 \u943 \u957 \u951 \u962  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u8037 \u961 \u945 \u962  \u959 \u8016 \u948 \u949 \u8054 \u962  \u959 \u7990 \u948 \u949 \u957 , \u959 \u8016 \u948 \u8050  \u959 \u7985  \u7940 \u947 \u947 \u949 \u955 \u959 \u953  \u964 \u8182 \u957  \u959 \u8016 \u961 \u945 \u957 \u8182 \u957  \u959 \u8016 \u948 \u8050  \u8001  \u933 \u7985 \u972 \u962 , \u949 \u7984  \u956 \u8052  \u8001  \u928 \u945 \u964 \u8052 \u961  \u956 \u972 \u957 \u959 \u962 ."*\
\
### **1599 Geneva:**\
*"But of that day and hour knoweth no man, no not the Angels of heaven, but my Father only."*\
\
---\
\
### Observation of foundational weight\
\
**This is Jesus' own testimony**, identical to Mark 13:32:\
- The day and hour are known to **no man**.\
- Not even **the angels.**\
- **Not even the Son** (in many manuscripts; the 1599 Geneva does not include "neither the Son" here, but Mark 13:32 does include it).\
- **Only the Father.**\
\
Per our maxim #1 and the parallel in Mark 13:32 already established, **the Son does not know the day and hour; only the Father knows.** This is decisive for our foundation: the Father remains the supreme One God who alone holds the times in His own authority (Acts 1:7 \'97 *"the times or seasons which the Father hath put in His own power"*).\
\
The Son's reign at the Father's right hand is real and supreme over creation \'97 but He does not possess the Father's exclusive sovereignty over the timing of the consummation. The Father is greater (John 14:28); the Father alone knows the day.\
\
