# **GRAND SYNTHESIS \'97 The Consummation and the Father-Son Order**\
\
By the most explicit witness of 1 Corinthians 15:24-28 \'97 supported by Revelation 11, 21, and 22 \'97 we now have the definitive picture of the end.\
\
## **The Order of the End \'97 Firmly Established**\
\
| Step | What Happens | Witnesses |\
|---|---|---|\
| **1. Christ's resurrection** | The firstfruits | 1 Cor 15:20-23 |\
| **2. The Son reigns at the Father's right hand** | Present session | Ps 110:1; Heb 10:12-13 |\
