**(1)** **\uc0\u8001  \u8034 \u957  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u8001  \u7974 \u957  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u8001  \u7952 \u961 \u967 \u972 \u956 \u949 \u957 \u959 \u962 ** \'97 *"the One who is, and who was, and who is to come."* This is the title of **the Father** \'97 the One who has eternal being, who was, who is, who is to come. It is John's expansion of the **\u7960 \u947 \u974  \u949 \u7984 \u956 \u953  \u8001  \u8036 \u957 ** ("I AM the One Who Is") of Exodus 3:14 LXX.\
