## **REVELATION 1:12-16 \'97 THE VISION OF THE SON OF MAN**\
\
### **Greek (vv. 12-16):**\
*"...\uc0\u7952 \u960 \u953 \u963 \u964 \u961 \u941 \u968 \u945 \u962  \u949 \u7990 \u948 \u959 \u957  \u7953 \u960 \u964 \u8048  \u955 \u965 \u967 \u957 \u943 \u945 \u962  \u967 \u961 \u965 \u963 \u8118 \u962 , \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u7952 \u957  \u956 \u941 \u963 \u8179  \u964 \u8182 \u957  \u955 \u965 \u967 \u957 \u953 \u8182 \u957  \u8005 \u956 \u959 \u953 \u959 \u957  \u965 \u7985 \u8056 \u957  \u7936 \u957 \u952 \u961 \u974 \u960 \u959 \u965 , \u7952 \u957 \u948 \u949 \u948 \u965 \u956 \u941 \u957 \u959 \u957  \u960 \u959 \u948 \u942 \u961 \u951  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u960 \u949 \u961 \u953 \u949 \u950 \u969 \u963 \u956 \u941 \u957 \u959 \u957  \u960 \u961 \u8056 \u962  \u964 \u959 \u8150 \u962  \u956 \u945 \u963 \u964 \u959 \u8150 \u962  \u950 \u974 \u957 \u951 \u957  \u967 \u961 \u965 \u963 \u8118 \u957 \'b7 \u7969  \u948 \u8050  \u954 \u949 \u966 \u945 \u955 \u8052  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u945 \u7985  \u964 \u961 \u943 \u967 \u949 \u962  \u955 \u949 \u965 \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u8033 \u962  \u7956 \u961 \u953 \u959 \u957  \u955 \u949 \u965 \u954 \u972 \u957 , \u8033 \u962  \u967 \u953 \u974 \u957 , \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u959 \u7985  \u8000 \u966 \u952 \u945 \u955 \u956 \u959 \u8054  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u8033 \u962  \u966 \u955 \u8056 \u958  \u960 \u965 \u961 \u972 \u962 , \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u959 \u7985  \u960 \u972 \u948 \u949 \u962  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u8005 \u956 \u959 \u953 \u959 \u953  \u967 \u945 \u955 \u954 \u959 \u955 \u953 \u946 \u940 \u957 \u8179  \u8033 \u962  \u7952 \u957  \u954 \u945 \u956 \u943 \u957 \u8179  \u960 \u949 \u960 \u965 \u961 \u969 \u956 \u941 \u957 \u951 \u962 , \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u7969  \u966 \u969 \u957 \u8052  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u8033 \u962  \u966 \u969 \u957 \u8052  \u8017 \u948 \u940 \u964 \u969 \u957  \u960 \u959 \u955 \u955 \u8182 \u957 , \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u7956 \u967 \u969 \u957  \u7952 \u957  \u964 \u8135  \u948 \u949 \u958 \u953 \u8119  \u967 \u949 \u953 \u961 \u8054  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u7936 \u963 \u964 \u941 \u961 \u945 \u962  \u7953 \u960 \u964 \u940 , \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u7952 \u954  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u963 \u964 \u972 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u959 \u962  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u8165 \u959 \u956 \u966 \u945 \u943 \u945  \u948 \u943 \u963 \u964 \u959 \u956 \u959 \u962  \u8000 \u958 \u949 \u8150 \u945  \u7952 \u954 \u960 \u959 \u961 \u949 \u965 \u959 \u956 \u941 \u957 \u951 , \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u7969  \u8004 \u968 \u953 \u962  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u8033 \u962  \u8001  \u7973 \u955 \u953 \u959 \u962  \u966 \u945 \u943 \u957 \u949 \u953  \u7952 \u957  \u964 \u8135  \u948 \u965 \u957 \u940 \u956 \u949 \u953  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166 ."*\
\
### **1599 Geneva:**\
*"...I turned back to see the voice, that spake with me: and when I was turned, I saw seven golden candlesticks, And in the midst of the seven candlesticks, one like unto the Son of man, clothed with a garment down to the feet, and girded about the paps with a golden girdle. His head, and hairs were white as white wool, and as snow, and his eyes were as a flame of fire, And his feet like unto fine brass, burning as in a furnace: and his voice as the sound of many waters. And he had in his right hand seven stars: and out of his mouth went a sharp two edged sword: and his face shone as the sun shineth in his strength."*\
\
---\
\
### Observations of the highest importance\
\
**(1)** **\uc0\u8005 \u956 \u959 \u953 \u959 \u957  \u965 \u7985 \u8056 \u957  \u7936 \u957 \u952 \u961 \u974 \u960 \u959 \u965 ** \'97 *"like a Son of Man."* This is the **Daniel 7:13 figure** \'97 and now we see Him directly. **Jesus retains His humanity in His exalted state** \'97 He is *"like a son of man,"* still bearing the form of the incarnate Christ.\
\
**(2)** **\uc0\u7969  \u954 \u949 \u966 \u945 \u955 \u8052  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u945 \u7985  \u964 \u961 \u943 \u967 \u949 \u962  \u955 \u949 \u965 \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u8033 \u962  \u7956 \u961 \u953 \u959 \u957  \u955 \u949 \u965 \u954 \u972 \u957 , \u8033 \u962  \u967 \u953 \u974 \u957 ** \'97 *"His head and hairs white as white wool, as snow."*\
\
**This is a striking detail.** Compare **Daniel 7:9 LXX:**\
*"...\uc0\u8001  \u952 \u961 \u8054 \u958  \u964 \u8134 \u962  \u954 \u949 \u966 \u945 \u955 \u8134 \u962  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u8033 \u963 \u949 \u8054  \u7956 \u961 \u953 \u959 \u957  \u954 \u945 \u952 \u945 \u961 \u972 \u957 ..."* \'97 *"the hair of His head as pure wool..."* \'97 **describing the Ancient of Days (the Father).**\
\
**Honest theological observation:** The risen Christ in Revelation 1 bears the appearance of the Ancient of Days described in Daniel 7. He is described in features Daniel attributed to the Father.\
\
**How do we honestly handle this per our maxims?**\
\
We must be careful. The text **does not say** the Son IS the Ancient of Days \'97 Daniel 7 explicitly distinguishes them, and Jesus Himself cited Daniel 7 of His being *brought before* the Ancient of Days, not as being Him. What the text **does** show is that **the Son, in His glorified state, bears features of the Father's appearance** \'97 because He is **the \uc0\u949 \u7984 \u954 \u8060 \u957  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u920 \u949 \u959 \u8166  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u7936 \u959 \u961 \u940 \u964 \u959 \u965 ** (Col 1:15), **the \u7936 \u960 \u945 \u973 \u947 \u945 \u963 \u956 \u945  \u964 \u8134 \u962  \u948 \u972 \u958 \u951 \u962  and \u967 \u945 \u961 \u945 \u954 \u964 \u8052 \u961  \u964 \u8134 \u962  \u8017 \u960 \u959 \u963 \u964 \u940 \u963 \u949 \u969 \u962  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166 ** (Heb 1:3) \'97 the Image, the Radiance, the exact Impression of the Father.\
\
The Son's glorified appearance **reflects and bears** the Father's glory. This is consistent with John 17:5 \'97 *"glorify Me with the glory I had with You before the world was."* The Son's glory is the Father's glory shared with Him.\
\
So we note honestly: **the Son in His glorified state shares the visible glory of the Father, without being identical to the Father.** The Lamb is the **Image** through whom the Father's glory is seen (Rev 21:23 \'97 *"the glory of God did light it: and the Lamb is the light thereof"*).\
\
