### Observations of supreme importance\
\
**(1)** **\uc0\u7968 \u947 \u972 \u961 \u945 \u963 \u945 \u962  \u964 \u8183  \u920 \u949 \u8183  \u7952 \u957  \u964 \u8183  \u945 \u7989 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u943  \u963 \u959 \u965 ** \'97 *"Thou hast redeemed [us] **to God** by Thy blood."* The Lamb's redemption is **for God [the Father]**. The Lamb purchases people **for the Father.** Pattern preserved: the Son's work is **unto** the Father.\
\
**(2)** **\uc0\u964 \u8183  \u920 \u949 \u8183  \u7969 \u956 \u8182 \u957 ** \'97 *"to our God."* The Father is **"our God"** \'97 the God of the redeemed. The Lamb has made us **kings and priests to His God and Father** (cf. Rev 1:6).\
