### **Clause 2: \uc0\u964 \u942 \u957  \u964 \u949  \u7952 \u960 \u945 \u947 \u947 \u949 \u955 \u943 \u945 \u957  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u973 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u959 \u962  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u7945 \u947 \u943 \u959 \u965  \u955 \u945 \u946 \u8060 \u957  \u960 \u945 \u961 \u8048  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u928 \u945 \u964 \u961 \u8056 \u962 **\
