**(2) \uc0\u955 \u945 \u946 \u8060 \u957  \u960 \u945 \u961 \u8048  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u928 \u945 \u964 \u961 \u972 \u962 ** \'97 *"having received from beside the Father."*\
