**(1)** **\uc0\u7952 \u947 \u8060  \u950 \u8182  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u8017 \u956 \u949 \u8150 \u962  \u950 \u942 \u963 \u949 \u964 \u949 ** \'97 *"Because I live, you shall live also."*\
