**(2)** **\uc0\u7952 \u957  \u7952 \u954 \u949 \u943 \u957 \u8131  \u964 \u8135  \u7969 \u956 \u941 \u961 \u8115  \u947 \u957 \u974 \u963 \u949 \u963 \u952 \u949 ** \'97 *"In that day you shall know..."*\
