**(4) The decisive promise: \uc0\u960 \u961 \u8056 \u962  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u7952 \u955 \u949 \u965 \u963 \u972 \u956 \u949 \u952 \u945  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u956 \u959 \u957 \u8052 \u957  \u960 \u945 \u961 \u8125  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u8183  \u960 \u959 \u953 \u951 \u963 \u972 \u956 \u949 \u952 \u945 **\
\
