\
### **John 17:17-19** \'97 Sanctified in Truth:\
\
*"\uc0\u7937 \u947 \u943 \u945 \u963 \u959 \u957  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8058 \u962  \u7952 \u957  \u964 \u8135  \u7936 \u955 \u951 \u952 \u949 \u943 \u8115 \'b7 \u8001  \u955 \u972 \u947 \u959 \u962  \u8001  \u963 \u8056 \u962  \u7936 \u955 \u942 \u952 \u949 \u953 \u940  \u7952 \u963 \u964 \u953 \u957 ... \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u8017 \u960 \u8050 \u961  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u8182 \u957  \u7952 \u947 \u8060  \u7937 \u947 \u953 \u940 \u950 \u969  \u7952 \u956 \u945 \u965 \u964 \u972 \u957 , \u7989 \u957 \u945  \u8038 \u963 \u953 \u957  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8054  \u7969 \u947 \u953 \u945 \u963 \u956 \u941 \u957 \u959 \u953  \u7952 \u957  \u7936 \u955 \u951 \u952 \u949 \u943 \u8115 ."*\
\
### **1599 Geneva:**\
*"Sanctify them with thy truth: thy word is truth... And for their sakes sanctify I my self, that they also may be sanctified through the truth."*\
\
The Son sanctifies Himself (sets Himself apart for the sacrificial offering) for the disciples' sake, that **they may be sanctified in truth**. The Son's self-sanctification on the cross is the basis of our sanctification. This sets up the indwelling possibility \'97 for the Father (the Holy Spirit) cannot indwell the unsanctified.\
\
Now we arrive at the prayer for us.\
\
