### **1599 Geneva:**\
*"For I through the Law am dead to the Law, that I might live unto God. I am crucified with Christ, but I live, yet not I anymore, but Christ liveth in me: and in that, that I now live in the flesh, I live by the faith in the Son of God, who hath loved me, and given himself for me."*\
