| **Co-crucified with Christ** | \uc0\u963 \u965 \u963 \u964 \u945 \u965 \u961 \u972 \u969  | Gal 2:20; Rom 6:6 |\
| **Died with Christ** | \uc0\u963 \u965 \u957 \u945 \u960 \u959 \u952 \u957 \u8132 \u963 \u954 \u969  | Rom 6:8; 2 Tim 2:11 |\
