- **\uc0\u948 \u953 \u974 \u958 \u969 \u963 \u953 \u957 ** \'97 being persecuted (active hostility, possibly physical).\
- **\uc0\u949 \u7988 \u960 \u969 \u963 \u953 \u957  \u960 \u8118 \u957  \u960 \u959 \u957 \u951 \u961 \u8056 \u957  \u954 \u945 \u952 \u8125  \u8017 \u956 \u8182 \u957  \u968 \u949 \u965 \u948 \u972 \u956 \u949 \u957 \u959 \u953 ** \'97 having all manner of evil spoken against you falsely (slander, defamation).\
