### **John 15:21 (Greek):**\
*"\uc0\u7936 \u955 \u955 \u8048  \u964 \u945 \u8166 \u964 \u945  \u960 \u940 \u957 \u964 \u945  \u960 \u959 \u953 \u942 \u963 \u959 \u965 \u963 \u953 \u957  \u949 \u7984 \u962  \u8017 \u956 \u8118 \u962  \u948 \u953 \u8048  \u964 \u8056  \u8004 \u957 \u959 \u956 \u940  \u956 \u959 \u965 , \u8005 \u964 \u953  \u959 \u8016 \u954  \u959 \u7988 \u948 \u945 \u963 \u953 \u957  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u960 \u941 \u956 \u968 \u945 \u957 \u964 \u940  \u956 \u949 ."*\
