## **GALATIANS 5:24-25 \'97 A SUCCINCT STATEMENT**\
\
### **Greek:**\
*"\uc0\u959 \u7985  \u948 \u8050  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u935 \u961 \u953 \u963 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u7992 \u951 \u963 \u959 \u8166  \u964 \u8052 \u957  \u963 \u940 \u961 \u954 \u945  \u7952 \u963 \u964 \u945 \u973 \u961 \u969 \u963 \u945 \u957  \u963 \u8058 \u957  \u964 \u959 \u8150 \u962  \u960 \u945 \u952 \u942 \u956 \u945 \u963 \u953 \u957  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u964 \u945 \u8150 \u962  \u7952 \u960 \u953 \u952 \u965 \u956 \u943 \u945 \u953 \u962 . \u949 \u7984  \u950 \u8182 \u956 \u949 \u957  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u973 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u953 , \u928 \u957 \u949 \u973 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u953  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u963 \u964 \u959 \u953 \u967 \u8182 \u956 \u949 \u957 ."*\
