## **EPHESIANS 4:22-24 \'97 PUTTING OFF AND PUTTING ON**\
\
### **Greek:**\
*"\uc0\u7936 \u960 \u959 \u952 \u941 \u963 \u952 \u945 \u953  \u8017 \u956 \u8118 \u962  \u954 \u945 \u964 \u8048  \u964 \u8052 \u957  \u960 \u961 \u959 \u964 \u941 \u961 \u945 \u957  \u7936 \u957 \u945 \u963 \u964 \u961 \u959 \u966 \u8052 \u957  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u960 \u945 \u955 \u945 \u953 \u8056 \u957  \u7940 \u957 \u952 \u961 \u969 \u960 \u959 \u957  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u966 \u952 \u949 \u953 \u961 \u972 \u956 \u949 \u957 \u959 \u957  \u954 \u945 \u964 \u8048  \u964 \u8048 \u962  \u7952 \u960 \u953 \u952 \u965 \u956 \u943 \u945 \u962  \u964 \u8134 \u962  \u7936 \u960 \u940 \u964 \u951 \u962 , \u7936 \u957 \u945 \u957 \u949 \u959 \u8166 \u963 \u952 \u945 \u953  \u948 \u8050  \u964 \u8183  \u960 \u957 \u949 \u973 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u953  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u957 \u959 \u8056 \u962  \u8017 \u956 \u8182 \u957 , \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u7952 \u957 \u948 \u973 \u963 \u945 \u963 \u952 \u945 \u953  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u954 \u945 \u953 \u957 \u8056 \u957  \u7940 \u957 \u952 \u961 \u969 \u960 \u959 \u957  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u954 \u945 \u964 \u8048  \u920 \u949 \u8056 \u957  \u954 \u964 \u953 \u963 \u952 \u941 \u957 \u964 \u945  \u7952 \u957  \u948 \u953 \u954 \u945 \u953 \u959 \u963 \u973 \u957 \u8131  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u8001 \u963 \u953 \u972 \u964 \u951 \u964 \u953  \u964 \u8134 \u962  \u7936 \u955 \u951 \u952 \u949 \u943 \u945 \u962 ."*\
