# **ROMANS 8:5-8 \'97 THE TWO MIND-SETS**\
\
### **Greek:**\
*"\uc0\u959 \u7985  \u947 \u8048 \u961  \u954 \u945 \u964 \u8048  \u963 \u940 \u961 \u954 \u945  \u8004 \u957 \u964 \u949 \u962  \u964 \u8048  \u964 \u8134 \u962  \u963 \u945 \u961 \u954 \u8056 \u962  \u966 \u961 \u959 \u957 \u959 \u8166 \u963 \u953 \u957 , \u959 \u7985  \u948 \u8050  \u954 \u945 \u964 \u8048  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u8166 \u956 \u945  \u964 \u8048  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u973 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u959 \u962 . \u964 \u8056  \u947 \u8048 \u961  \u966 \u961 \u972 \u957 \u951 \u956 \u945  \u964 \u8134 \u962  \u963 \u945 \u961 \u954 \u8056 \u962  \u952 \u940 \u957 \u945 \u964 \u959 \u962 , \u964 \u8056  \u948 \u8050  \u966 \u961 \u972 \u957 \u951 \u956 \u945  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u973 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u959 \u962  \u950 \u969 \u8052  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u949 \u7984 \u961 \u942 \u957 \u951 \'b7 \u948 \u953 \u972 \u964 \u953  \u964 \u8056  \u966 \u961 \u972 \u957 \u951 \u956 \u945  \u964 \u8134 \u962  \u963 \u945 \u961 \u954 \u8056 \u962  \u7956 \u967 \u952 \u961 \u945  \u949 \u7984 \u962  \u920 \u949 \u972 \u957 , \u964 \u8183  \u947 \u8048 \u961  \u957 \u972 \u956 \u8179  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u920 \u949 \u959 \u8166  \u959 \u8016 \u967  \u8017 \u960 \u959 \u964 \u940 \u963 \u963 \u949 \u964 \u945 \u953 , \u959 \u8016 \u948 \u8050  \u947 \u8048 \u961  \u948 \u973 \u957 \u945 \u964 \u945 \u953 \'b7 \u959 \u7985  \u948 \u8050  \u7952 \u957  \u963 \u945 \u961 \u954 \u8054  \u8004 \u957 \u964 \u949 \u962  \u920 \u949 \u8183  \u7936 \u961 \u941 \u963 \u945 \u953  \u959 \u8016  \u948 \u973 \u957 \u945 \u957 \u964 \u945 \u953 ."*\
