# **ROMANS 8:9-11 \'97 THE INDWELLING SPIRIT**\
\
### **Greek:**\
*"\uc0\u8017 \u956 \u949 \u8150 \u962  \u948 \u8050  \u959 \u8016 \u954  \u7952 \u963 \u964 \u8050  \u7952 \u957  \u963 \u945 \u961 \u954 \u8054  \u7936 \u955 \u955 \u8048  \u7952 \u957  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u973 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u953 , \u949 \u7988 \u960 \u949 \u961  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u8166 \u956 \u945  \u920 \u949 \u959 \u8166  \u959 \u7984 \u954 \u949 \u8150  \u7952 \u957  \u8017 \u956 \u8150 \u957 . \u949 \u7984  \u948 \u941  \u964 \u953 \u962  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u8166 \u956 \u945  \u935 \u961 \u953 \u963 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u959 \u8016 \u954  \u7956 \u967 \u949 \u953 , \u959 \u8023 \u964 \u959 \u962  \u959 \u8016 \u954  \u7956 \u963 \u964 \u953 \u957  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166 . \u949 \u7984  \u948 \u8050  \u935 \u961 \u953 \u963 \u964 \u8056 \u962  \u7952 \u957  \u8017 \u956 \u8150 \u957 , \u964 \u8056  \u956 \u8050 \u957  \u963 \u8182 \u956 \u945  \u957 \u949 \u954 \u961 \u8056 \u957  \u948 \u953 \u8048  \u7937 \u956 \u945 \u961 \u964 \u943 \u945 \u957 , \u964 \u8056  \u948 \u8050  \u960 \u957 \u949 \u8166 \u956 \u945  \u950 \u969 \u8052  \u948 \u953 \u8048  \u948 \u953 \u954 \u945 \u953 \u959 \u963 \u973 \u957 \u951 \u957 . \u949 \u7984  \u948 \u8050  \u964 \u8056  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u8166 \u956 \u945  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u7952 \u947 \u949 \u943 \u961 \u945 \u957 \u964 \u959 \u962  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u7992 \u951 \u963 \u959 \u8166 \u957  \u7952 \u954  \u957 \u949 \u954 \u961 \u8182 \u957  \u959 \u7984 \u954 \u949 \u8150  \u7952 \u957  \u8017 \u956 \u8150 \u957 , \u8001  \u7952 \u947 \u949 \u943 \u961 \u945 \u962  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u935 \u961 \u953 \u963 \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u7952 \u954  \u957 \u949 \u954 \u961 \u8182 \u957  \u950 \u8179 \u959 \u960 \u959 \u953 \u942 \u963 \u949 \u953  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u964 \u8048  \u952 \u957 \u951 \u964 \u8048  \u963 \u974 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u945  \u8017 \u956 \u8182 \u957  \u948 \u953 \u8048  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u7952 \u957 \u959 \u953 \u954 \u959 \u8166 \u957 \u964 \u959 \u962  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u973 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u959 \u962  \u7952 \u957  \u8017 \u956 \u8150 \u957 ."*\
\
### **1599 Geneva:**\
*"Now ye are not in the flesh, but in the Spirit, because the Spirit of God dwelleth in you: but if any man hath not the Spirit of Christ, the same is not his. And if Christ be in you, the body is dead, because of sin: but the Spirit is life for righteousness sake. But if the Spirit of him that raised up Jesus from the dead dwell in you, he that raised up Christ from the dead, shall also quicken your mortal bodies by his Spirit that dwelleth in you."*\
\
---\
\
### Observations of supreme importance\
\
**(1)** **\uc0\u8017 \u956 \u949 \u8150 \u962  \u948 \u8050  \u959 \u8016 \u954  \u7952 \u963 \u964 \u8050  \u7952 \u957  \u963 \u945 \u961 \u954 \u8054  \u7936 \u955 \u955 \u8048  \u7952 \u957  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u973 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u953 ** \'97 *"But you are not in the flesh, but in the Spirit."*\
\
**The indicative again.** Paul declares the believer's state: **you ARE in the Spirit, not in the flesh.** This is not a goal; it is your reality.\
\
The condition: **\uc0\u949 \u7988 \u960 \u949 \u961  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u8166 \u956 \u945  \u920 \u949 \u959 \u8166  \u959 \u7984 \u954 \u949 \u8150  \u7952 \u957  \u8017 \u956 \u8150 \u957 ** \'97 *"if indeed the Spirit of God dwells in you."* As in Rom 8:17, **\u949 \u7988 \u960 \u949 \u961 ** is more *"since indeed"* than *"if"* \'97 Paul assumes the condition is met. **The indwelling Spirit is the mark of belonging to Christ.**\
\
**(2)** **\uc0\u949 \u7984  \u948 \u941  \u964 \u953 \u962  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u8166 \u956 \u945  \u935 \u961 \u953 \u963 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u959 \u8016 \u954  \u7956 \u967 \u949 \u953 , \u959 \u8023 \u964 \u959 \u962  \u959 \u8016 \u954  \u7956 \u963 \u964 \u953 \u957  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166 ** \'97 *"If anyone does not have the Spirit of Christ, he is not His."*\
\
**The Spirit's indwelling is the sine qua non of belonging to Christ.** Without the indwelling Spirit, one does not belong to Christ. This is a settled NT principle.\
\
Note the interchangeable language:\
- **\uc0\u928 \u957 \u949 \u8166 \u956 \u945  \u920 \u949 \u959 \u8166 ** \'97 *"Spirit of God"* (the Father's Spirit).\
- **\uc0\u928 \u957 \u949 \u8166 \u956 \u945  \u935 \u961 \u953 \u963 \u964 \u959 \u8166 ** \'97 *"Spirit of Christ"* (the Son's Spirit).\
- **\uc0\u935 \u961 \u953 \u963 \u964 \u8056 \u962  \u7952 \u957  \u8017 \u956 \u8150 \u957 ** \'97 *"Christ in you."*\
\
These are not three different realities; they are **one indwelling Presence described from three angles** \'97 consistent with what we established in Parts E and F. The Father (Spirit) indwells in the Son (Christ in you), and the indwelling is mediated by the Spirit Christ has poured out (Acts 2:33).\
\
**(3)** **\uc0\u964 \u8056  \u956 \u8050 \u957  \u963 \u8182 \u956 \u945  \u957 \u949 \u954 \u961 \u8056 \u957  \u948 \u953 \u8048  \u7937 \u956 \u945 \u961 \u964 \u943 \u945 \u957 , \u964 \u8056  \u948 \u8050  \u960 \u957 \u949 \u8166 \u956 \u945  \u950 \u969 \u8052  \u948 \u953 \u8048  \u948 \u953 \u954 \u945 \u953 \u959 \u963 \u973 \u957 \u951 \u957 ** \'97 *"the body is dead because of sin, but the spirit is life because of righteousness."*\
\
A sober honesty. The body is still mortal \'97 under the sentence of death because of sin. The body still bears the corruption inherited from Adam. But the spirit (the believer's regenerated inner being, indwelt by the Holy Spirit) is **life** \'97 because of righteousness imparted in Christ.\
\
**(4)** The promise of v. 11: **\uc0\u8001  \u7952 \u947 \u949 \u943 \u961 \u945 \u962  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u935 \u961 \u953 \u963 \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u7952 \u954  \u957 \u949 \u954 \u961 \u8182 \u957  \u950 \u8179 \u959 \u960 \u959 \u953 \u942 \u963 \u949 \u953  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u964 \u8048  \u952 \u957 \u951 \u964 \u8048  \u963 \u974 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u945  \u8017 \u956 \u8182 \u957  \u948 \u953 \u8048  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u7952 \u957 \u959 \u953 \u954 \u959 \u8166 \u957 \u964 \u959 \u962  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u973 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u959 \u962  \u7952 \u957  \u8017 \u956 \u8150 \u957 ** \'97 *"He who raised Christ from the dead will also give life to your mortal bodies through His Spirit who dwells in you."*\
\
**The Spirit's indwelling work extends to our mortal bodies.** This points forward to the resurrection (Rom 8:23 \'97 *the redemption of our body*), but it also has a **present** dimension \'97 the Spirit who indwells gives life to our mortal bodies even now, enabling them to be presented as instruments of righteousness (Rom 6:13; 12:1).\
\
The Father's resurrection power is at work in the believer's body through the indwelling Spirit \'97 **the same power that raised the Son from the dead.**\
\
