# **ROMANS 8:14-17 \'97 SONS OF GOD**\
\
### **Greek (selections):**\
*"\uc0\u8005 \u963 \u959 \u953  \u947 \u8048 \u961  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u973 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u953  \u920 \u949 \u959 \u8166  \u7940 \u947 \u959 \u957 \u964 \u945 \u953 , \u959 \u8023 \u964 \u959 \u953  \u965 \u7985 \u959 \u943  \u949 \u7984 \u963 \u953 \u957  \u920 \u949 \u959 \u8166 . \u959 \u8016  \u947 \u8048 \u961  \u7952 \u955 \u940 \u946 \u949 \u964 \u949  \u960 \u957 \u949 \u8166 \u956 \u945  \u948 \u959 \u965 \u955 \u949 \u943 \u945 \u962  \u960 \u940 \u955 \u953 \u957  \u949 \u7984 \u962  \u966 \u972 \u946 \u959 \u957 , \u7936 \u955 \u955 \u8048  \u7952 \u955 \u940 \u946 \u949 \u964 \u949  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u8166 \u956 \u945  \u965 \u7985 \u959 \u952 \u949 \u963 \u943 \u945 \u962  \u7952 \u957  \u8103  \u954 \u961 \u940 \u950 \u959 \u956 \u949 \u957 \'b7 \u7944 \u946 \u946 \u940 , \u8001  \u928 \u945 \u964 \u942 \u961 . \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u8056  \u964 \u8056  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u8166 \u956 \u945  \u963 \u965 \u956 \u956 \u945 \u961 \u964 \u965 \u961 \u949 \u8150  \u964 \u8183  \u960 \u957 \u949 \u973 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u953  \u7969 \u956 \u8182 \u957  \u8005 \u964 \u953  \u7952 \u963 \u956 \u8050 \u957  \u964 \u941 \u954 \u957 \u945  \u920 \u949 \u959 \u8166 . \u949 \u7984  \u948 \u8050  \u964 \u941 \u954 \u957 \u945 , \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u954 \u955 \u951 \u961 \u959 \u957 \u972 \u956 \u959 \u953 ..."*\
\
### **1599 Geneva:**\
*"For as many as are led by the Spirit of God, they are the sons of God. For ye have not received the Spirit of bondage, to fear again: but ye have received the Spirit of adoption, whereby we cry, Abba, Father. The same Spirit beareth witness with our spirit, that we are the children of God. If we be children, we are also heirs..."*\
\
---\
\
### Observations\
\
We already touched on these verses in our earlier examination of co-suffering. Let us now note their place in the Spirit-led walk.\
\
**(1)** **\uc0\u8005 \u963 \u959 \u953  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u973 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u953  \u920 \u949 \u959 \u8166  \u7940 \u947 \u959 \u957 \u964 \u945 \u953 ** \'97 *"as many as are led by the Spirit of God."* The believer is **led** by the Spirit \'97 guided in the path of righteousness, in the will of the Father, in the imitation of the Son.\
\
**(2)** **\uc0\u928 \u957 \u949 \u8166 \u956 \u945  \u965 \u7985 \u959 \u952 \u949 \u963 \u943 \u945 \u962 ** \'97 *"the Spirit of adoption."* The Spirit not only empowers but also **witnesses to** the believer's sonship. He brings the believer into the conscious relation of son to Father \'97 crying out **"Abba, Father"** \'97 with the same intimacy the Son Himself used (Mark 14:36).\
\
**(3)** **\uc0\u945 \u8016 \u964 \u8056  \u964 \u8056  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u8166 \u956 \u945  \u963 \u965 \u956 \u956 \u945 \u961 \u964 \u965 \u961 \u949 \u8150  \u964 \u8183  \u960 \u957 \u949 \u973 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u953  \u7969 \u956 \u8182 \u957 ** \'97 *"the Spirit Himself bears witness with our spirit."* The Spirit's inner witness \'97 assuring us we are God's children \'97 is itself a means by which He empowers us. We walk in the confidence of sonship, not the fear of slavery.\
\
