\
# **ROMANS 8:31-39 \'97 THE UNBREAKABLE SECURITY**\
\
This is the climax of the chapter \'97 and perhaps the climax of the entire Pauline corpus. We will not exposit every verse (we have referenced it before), but let us note the central practical truth.\
\
### **Romans 8:31-32 (Greek):**\
*"\uc0\u932 \u943  \u959 \u8022 \u957  \u7952 \u961 \u959 \u8166 \u956 \u949 \u957  \u960 \u961 \u8056 \u962  \u964 \u945 \u8166 \u964 \u945 ; \u949 \u7984  \u8001  \u920 \u949 \u8056 \u962  \u8017 \u960 \u8050 \u961  \u7969 \u956 \u8182 \u957 , \u964 \u943 \u962  \u954 \u945 \u952 \u8125  \u7969 \u956 \u8182 \u957 ; \u8005 \u962  \u947 \u949  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u7984 \u948 \u943 \u959 \u965  \u933 \u7985 \u959 \u8166  \u959 \u8016 \u954  \u7952 \u966 \u949 \u943 \u963 \u945 \u964 \u959 , \u7936 \u955 \u955 \u8048  \u8017 \u960 \u8050 \u961  \u7969 \u956 \u8182 \u957  \u960 \u940 \u957 \u964 \u969 \u957  \u960 \u945 \u961 \u941 \u948 \u969 \u954 \u949 \u957  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u972 \u957 , \u960 \u8182 \u962  \u959 \u8016 \u967 \u8054  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u963 \u8058 \u957  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u8183  \u964 \u8048  \u960 \u940 \u957 \u964 \u945  \u7969 \u956 \u8150 \u957  \u967 \u945 \u961 \u943 \u963 \u949 \u964 \u945 \u953 ;"*\
\
