The perfect statement of the cooperative relationship. **The believer works out** \'97 k\uc0\u945 \u964 \u949 \u961 \u947 \u940 \u950 \u949 \u963 \u952 \u949  \'97 what is already true. **God works in** \'97 \u7952 \u957 \u949 \u961 \u947 \u8182 \u957  \u7952 \u957  \u8017 \u956 \u8150 \u957  \'97 both the willing and the working. The believer's effort and God's empowering are not opposed; they are integrated. The believer's responsibility is **to work out what God works in.**\
