## **Galatians 5:13-15 \'97 FREEDOM, NOT LICENSE**\
\
### **Greek:**\
*"\uc0\u8025 \u956 \u949 \u8150 \u962  \u947 \u8048 \u961  \u7952 \u960 \u8125  \u7952 \u955 \u949 \u965 \u952 \u949 \u961 \u943 \u8115  \u7952 \u954 \u955 \u942 \u952 \u951 \u964 \u949 , \u7936 \u948 \u949 \u955 \u966 \u959 \u943 \'b7 \u956 \u972 \u957 \u959 \u957  \u956 \u8052  \u964 \u8052 \u957  \u7952 \u955 \u949 \u965 \u952 \u949 \u961 \u943 \u945 \u957  \u949 \u7984 \u962  \u7936 \u966 \u959 \u961 \u956 \u8052 \u957  \u964 \u8135  \u963 \u945 \u961 \u954 \u943 , \u7936 \u955 \u955 \u8048  \u948 \u953 \u8048  \u964 \u8134 \u962  \u7936 \u947 \u940 \u960 \u951 \u962  \u948 \u959 \u965 \u955 \u949 \u973 \u949 \u964 \u949  \u7936 \u955 \u955 \u942 \u955 \u959 \u953 \u962 . \u8001  \u947 \u8048 \u961  \u960 \u8118 \u962  \u957 \u972 \u956 \u959 \u962  \u7952 \u957  \u7953 \u957 \u8054  \u955 \u972 \u947 \u8179  \u960 \u949 \u960 \u955 \u942 \u961 \u969 \u964 \u945 \u953 , \u7952 \u957  \u964 \u8183 \'b7 \u7944 \u947 \u945 \u960 \u942 \u963 \u949 \u953 \u962  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u960 \u955 \u951 \u963 \u943 \u959 \u957  \u963 \u959 \u965  \u8033 \u962  \u963 \u949 \u945 \u965 \u964 \u972 \u957 ."*\
\
### **1599 Geneva:**\
*"For brethren, ye have been called unto liberty: only use not your liberty as an occasion unto the flesh: but by love serve one another. For all the Law is fulfilled in one word, which is this, Thou shalt love thy neighbor as thyself."*\
\
---\
\
### Observation\
\
The believer is called to freedom \'97 but freedom is not license. The believer is freed **from** the flesh's tyranny, not freed **for** the flesh's gratification. The believer's freedom is fulfilled in **loving service** to one another.\
\
**The whole law is fulfilled in love** (citing Lev 19:18) \'97 not because the believer is under the law for justification, but because the believer, walking by the Spirit, produces what the law required.\
\
