## **Galatians 5:19-21 \'97 THE WORKS OF THE FLESH**\
\
### **Greek:**\
*"\uc0\u966 \u945 \u957 \u949 \u961 \u8048  \u948 \u941  \u7952 \u963 \u964 \u953 \u957  \u964 \u8048  \u7956 \u961 \u947 \u945  \u964 \u8134 \u962  \u963 \u945 \u961 \u954 \u972 \u962 , \u7941 \u964 \u953 \u957 \u940  \u7952 \u963 \u964 \u953 \u957  \u960 \u959 \u961 \u957 \u949 \u943 \u945 , \u7936 \u954 \u945 \u952 \u945 \u961 \u963 \u943 \u945 , \u7936 \u963 \u941 \u955 \u947 \u949 \u953 \u945 , \u949 \u7984 \u948 \u969 \u955 \u959 \u955 \u945 \u964 \u961 \u943 \u945 , \u966 \u945 \u961 \u956 \u945 \u954 \u949 \u943 \u945 , \u7956 \u967 \u952 \u961 \u945 \u953 , \u7956 \u961 \u953 \u962 , \u950 \u8134 \u955 \u959 \u962 , \u952 \u965 \u956 \u959 \u943 , \u7952 \u961 \u953 \u952 \u949 \u8150 \u945 \u953 , \u948 \u953 \u967 \u959 \u963 \u964 \u945 \u963 \u943 \u945 \u953 , \u945 \u7985 \u961 \u941 \u963 \u949 \u953 \u962 , \u966 \u952 \u972 \u957 \u959 \u953 , \u956 \u941 \u952 \u945 \u953 , \u954 \u8182 \u956 \u959 \u953 , \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u964 \u8048  \u8005 \u956 \u959 \u953 \u945  \u964 \u959 \u973 \u964 \u959 \u953 \u962 , \u7939  \u960 \u961 \u959 \u955 \u941 \u947 \u969  \u8017 \u956 \u8150 \u957  \u954 \u945 \u952 \u8060 \u962  \u960 \u961 \u959 \u949 \u8150 \u960 \u959 \u957  \u8005 \u964 \u953  \u959 \u7985  \u964 \u8048  \u964 \u959 \u953 \u945 \u8166 \u964 \u945  \u960 \u961 \u940 \u963 \u963 \u959 \u957 \u964 \u949 \u962  \u946 \u945 \u963 \u953 \u955 \u949 \u943 \u945 \u957  \u920 \u949 \u959 \u8166  \u959 \u8016  \u954 \u955 \u951 \u961 \u959 \u957 \u959 \u956 \u942 \u963 \u959 \u965 \u963 \u953 \u957 ."*\
\
### **1599 Geneva:**\
*"Moreover the works of the flesh are manifest, which are adultery, fornication, uncleanness, wantonness, Idolatry, witchcraft, hatred, debate, emulations, wrath, contentions, seditions, heresies, Envy, murders, drunkenness, gluttony, and such like, whereof I tell you before, as I also have told you before, that they which do such things, shall not inherit the kingdom of God."*\
\
---\
\
### Observations\
\
**(1)** **\uc0\u966 \u945 \u957 \u949 \u961 \u940 ** \'97 *"manifest, plain to see."* The works of the flesh are obvious. They are not hidden mysteries; they are visible in the lives of those who walk by the flesh.\
\
**(2) The list is comprehensive** \'97 covering:\
- **Sexual immorality** (\uc0\u960 \u959 \u961 \u957 \u949 \u943 \u945 , \u7936 \u954 \u945 \u952 \u945 \u961 \u963 \u943 \u945 , \u7936 \u963 \u941 \u955 \u947 \u949 \u953 \u945 ).\
- **False religion** (\uc0\u949 \u7984 \u948 \u969 \u955 \u959 \u955 \u945 \u964 \u961 \u943 \u945 , \u966 \u945 \u961 \u956 \u945 \u954 \u949 \u943 \u945  \'97 idolatry, sorcery).\
- **Relational disorder** (\uc0\u7956 \u967 \u952 \u961 \u945 \u953 , \u7956 \u961 \u953 \u962 , \u950 \u8134 \u955 \u959 \u962 , \u952 \u965 \u956 \u959 \u943 , \u7952 \u961 \u953 \u952 \u949 \u8150 \u945 \u953 , \u948 \u953 \u967 \u959 \u963 \u964 \u945 \u963 \u943 \u945 \u953 , \u945 \u7985 \u961 \u941 \u963 \u949 \u953 \u962 , \u966 \u952 \u972 \u957 \u959 \u953  \'97 hatred, strife, jealousy, outbursts of wrath, selfish ambition, dissensions, factions, envy).\
- **Lifestyle excess** (\uc0\u956 \u941 \u952 \u945 \u953 , \u954 \u8182 \u956 \u959 \u953  \'97 drunkenness, revelries).\
\
**The list is not exhaustive** \'97 *"and such like"* (\uc0\u954 \u945 \u8054  \u964 \u8048  \u8005 \u956 \u959 \u953 \u945  \u964 \u959 \u973 \u964 \u959 \u953 \u962 ) \'97 but illustrative. The flesh produces these kinds of things wherever it reigns.\
\
**(3) The warning:** *"They which do such things shall not inherit the kingdom of God."*\
\
This is sobering. **A pattern of life characterized by the works of the flesh** is incompatible with citizenship in the kingdom. Paul is not saying a believer who falls into one of these sins is lost; he is saying that **those whose lives are characterized by these patterns** demonstrate they are not in the Spirit's possession.\
\
The mark of a true believer is not the absence of all sin (we still battle the flesh), but the **direction** of life \'97 being increasingly turned away from these patterns by the Spirit's work.\
\
