**(1)** **\uc0\u959 \u7985  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u935 \u961 \u953 \u963 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u7992 \u951 \u963 \u959 \u8166  \u964 \u8052 \u957  \u963 \u940 \u961 \u954 \u945  \u7952 \u963 \u964 \u945 \u973 \u961 \u969 \u963 \u945 \u957 ** \'97 *"those who belong to Christ Jesus have crucified the flesh."* Aorist tense \'97 a completed past act.\
\
