\
**(2)** **\uc0\u949 \u7984  \u950 \u8182 \u956 \u949 \u957  \u928 \u957 \u949 \u973 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u953 , \u928 \u957 \u949 \u973 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u953  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u963 \u964 \u959 \u953 \u967 \u8182 \u956 \u949 \u957 ** \'97 *"if we live by the Spirit, let us also walk by the Spirit."*\
