The verb **\uc0\u963 \u964 \u959 \u953 \u967 \u8182 \u956 \u949 \u957 ** is military \'97 *"march in step, walk in line, keep in formation."* The believer who lives by the Spirit is to **march in step with the Spirit** \'97 keeping in line with His leading, His pace, His direction.\
