# **PART 3 \'97 COLOSSIANS 3: THE PUTTING OFF AND PUTTING ON**\
\
## **The Context**\
\
Paul has just spent Colossians 1-2 establishing the supremacy and fullness of Christ \'97 Creator, Sustainer, Head of the Body, the Image of the invisible God, in whom dwells all the fullness of the Godhead bodily. He has warned against false philosophies that would diminish Christ. Now in chapter 3, he turns to the practical implications: **since you are united with this Christ, here is how you walk.**\
