- **\uc0\u967 \u945 \u961 \u953 \u950 \u972 \u956 \u949 \u957 \u959 \u953  \u7953 \u945 \u965 \u964 \u959 \u8150 \u962 ** \'97 forgiving one another (literally, *"granting grace"*)\
\
**(3) The pattern:** **\uc0\u954 \u945 \u952 \u8060 \u962  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u8001  \u922 \u973 \u961 \u953 \u959 \u962  \u7952 \u967 \u945 \u961 \u943 \u963 \u945 \u964 \u959  \u8017 \u956 \u8150 \u957  \u959 \u8021 \u964 \u969 \u962  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u8017 \u956 \u949 \u8150 \u962 ** \'97 *"as the Lord forgave you, so also you."*\
\
**The believer forgives because and as he has been forgiven.** The Father's gracious treatment in Christ becomes the pattern of our treatment of others.\
\
**(4)** **\uc0\u7952 \u960 \u8054  \u960 \u8118 \u963 \u953 \u957  \u948 \u8050  \u964 \u959 \u973 \u964 \u959 \u953 \u962  \u964 \u8052 \u957  \u7936 \u947 \u940 \u960 \u951 \u957 , \u8005  \u7952 \u963 \u964 \u953 \u957  \u963 \u973 \u957 \u948 \u949 \u963 \u956 \u959 \u962  \u964 \u8134 \u962  \u964 \u949 \u955 \u949 \u953 \u972 \u964 \u951 \u964 \u959 \u962 ** \'97 *"and above all these things, love, which is the bond of perfectness."*\
\
**Love is the binding garment that holds all the others together.** Without love, kindness becomes flattery, humility becomes self-loathing, patience becomes mere endurance. **Love is the unifying principle.**\
\
**(5)** **\uc0\u7969  \u949 \u7984 \u961 \u942 \u957 \u951  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u935 \u961 \u953 \u963 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u946 \u961 \u945 \u946 \u949 \u965 \u941 \u964 \u969  \u7952 \u957  \u964 \u945 \u8150 \u962  \u954 \u945 \u961 \u948 \u943 \u945 \u953 \u962  \u8017 \u956 \u8182 \u957 ** \'97 *"let the peace of Christ rule in your hearts."*\
\
The verb **\uc0\u946 \u961 \u945 \u946 \u949 \u965 \u941 \u964 \u969 ** is from **\u946 \u961 \u945 \u946 \u949 \u973 \u962 ** \'97 *an umpire, an arbiter.* Christ's peace is to be the **umpire** in the believer's heart \'97 settling disputes, making decisions, ruling over conflicts. When peace departs from the heart, it is often the signal that something is wrong in our direction.\
