\
### **Greek:**\
*"\uc0\u954 \u945 \u8054  \u960 \u8118 \u957  \u8005  \u964 \u953  \u7952 \u8048 \u957  \u960 \u959 \u953 \u8134 \u964 \u949  \u7952 \u957  \u955 \u972 \u947 \u8179  \u7970  \u7952 \u957  \u7956 \u961 \u947 \u8179 , \u960 \u940 \u957 \u964 \u945  \u7952 \u957  \u8000 \u957 \u972 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u953  \u922 \u965 \u961 \u943 \u959 \u965  \u7992 \u951 \u963 \u959 \u8166 , \u949 \u8016 \u967 \u945 \u961 \u953 \u963 \u964 \u959 \u8166 \u957 \u964 \u949 \u962  \u964 \u8183  \u920 \u949 \u8183  \u928 \u945 \u964 \u961 \u8054  \u948 \u953 \u8125  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166 ."*\
