### Observation\
\
**The single, governing principle of all practical Christian living:**\
\
- **Whatever you do \'97 in word or deed \'97 do all in the Name of the Lord Jesus.**\
- **Give thanks to God the Father through Him.**\
\
Every action of the believer's life is to be done **in the Name of the Lord Jesus** \'97 that is, as one belonging to Him, representing Him, acting in His authority, for His glory. And every action is to be accompanied by **thanksgiving to the Father through Him.**\
\
**This single verse captures the comprehensive nature of Christian practice.** No part of life is excluded. No moment is secular. Every word and deed is to be in His Name and to the Father's glory.\
