# **THE QUESTION FRAMED PRECISELY**\
\
The question is not:\
- *"May we speak to Jesus?"* (of course \'97 He is our Lord)\
- *"May we love Jesus?"* (yes \'97 He is the Beloved)\
- *"May we confess Jesus as Lord?"* (yes \'97 this is required)\
\
The question is:\
- **Does Scripture *instruct* the believer to *pray to* Jesus as a normative practice?**\
- **Is prayer to Jesus a taught, commanded, modeled discipline in the New Testament?**\
\
This is a matter of what the God-breathed Word actually establishes \'97 not what tradition has practiced.\
\
---\
\
