\
### **Greek:**\
*"\uc0\u954 \u945 \u8054  \u963 \u967 \u942 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u953  \u949 \u8017 \u961 \u949 \u952 \u949 \u8054 \u962  \u8033 \u962  \u7940 \u957 \u952 \u961 \u969 \u960 \u959 \u962  \u7952 \u964 \u945 \u960 \u949 \u943 \u957 \u969 \u963 \u949 \u957  \u7953 \u945 \u965 \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u947 \u949 \u957 \u972 \u956 \u949 \u957 \u959 \u962  \u8017 \u960 \u942 \u954 \u959 \u959 \u962  \u956 \u941 \u967 \u961 \u953  \u952 \u945 \u957 \u940 \u964 \u959 \u965 , \u952 \u945 \u957 \u940 \u964 \u959 \u965  \u948 \u8050  \u963 \u964 \u945 \u965 \u961 \u959 \u8166 ."*\
