\
## **Phrase 1: \uc0\u963 \u967 \u942 \u956 \u945 \u964 \u953  \u949 \u8017 \u961 \u949 \u952 \u949 \u8054 \u962  \u8033 \u962  \u7940 \u957 \u952 \u961 \u969 \u960 \u959 \u962 **\
\
*"Being found in fashion as a man."*\
\
**\uc0\u963 \u967 \u8134 \u956 \u945 ** \'97 *"outward fashion, appearance, form."* Different from **\u956 \u959 \u961 \u966 \u942 ** \'97 this is the outward observable appearance.\
\
**In outward appearance, Jesus was found as a man.** People looking at Him saw a man. His humanity was real and visible.\
\
## **Phrase 2: \uc0\u7952 \u964 \u945 \u960 \u949 \u943 \u957 \u969 \u963 \u949 \u957  \u7953 \u945 \u965 \u964 \u8056 \u957 **\
\
