**The Son existed in the divine glory before His incarnation. He willingly humbled Himself to the form of a servant. He was obedient unto the death of the cross. The Father has exalted Him and given Him the Name above every name. Every knee shall bow, and every tongue confess Jesus Christ is Lord \'97 to the glory of God the Father.**\
