## **The Greek Text**\
\
*"\uc0\u7960 \u957  \u7936 \u961 \u967 \u8135  \u7974 \u957  \u8001  \u923 \u972 \u947 \u959 \u962 , \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u8001  \u923 \u972 \u947 \u959 \u962  \u7974 \u957  \u960 \u961 \u8056 \u962  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u920 \u949 \u972 \u957 , \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u920 \u949 \u8056 \u962  \u7974 \u957  \u8001  \u923 \u972 \u947 \u959 \u962 . \u959 \u8023 \u964 \u959 \u962  \u7974 \u957  \u7952 \u957  \u7936 \u961 \u967 \u8135  \u960 \u961 \u8056 \u962  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u920 \u949 \u972 \u957 . \u960 \u940 \u957 \u964 \u945  \u948 \u953 \u8125  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u7952 \u947 \u941 \u957 \u949 \u964 \u959 , \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u967 \u969 \u961 \u8054 \u962  \u945 \u8016 \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u7952 \u947 \u941 \u957 \u949 \u964 \u959  \u959 \u8016 \u948 \u8050  \u7955 \u957  \u8003  \u947 \u941 \u947 \u959 \u957 \u949 \u957 ."*\
