**\uc0\u947 \u949 \u957 \u941 \u963 \u952 \u945 \u953 ** \'97 aorist middle infinitive of **\u947 \u943 \u957 \u959 \u956 \u945 \u953 ** \'97 *"to come to be, to become, to be born."* Used of Abraham \'97 *"before Abraham came to be / was born."*\
