- **Isaiah 43:10 LXX:** *"\uc0\u7952 \u947 \u974  \u949 \u7984 \u956 \u953 "* \'97 *"I am He."*\
- **Isaiah 46:4 LXX:** *"\uc0\u7952 \u947 \u974  \u949 \u7984 \u956 \u953 "* \'97 *"I am He."*\
