## **This is a Direct Citation of Psalm 45:6-7 LXX**\
\
Let us examine the Psalm in its original context.\
\
### **Psalm 44:7-8 LXX (Psalm 45:6-7 MT):**\
\
*"\uc0\u8001  \u952 \u961 \u972 \u957 \u959 \u962  \u963 \u959 \u965 , \u8001  \u920 \u949 \u972 \u962 , \u949 \u7984 \u962  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u945 \u7984 \u8182 \u957 \u945  \u964 \u959 \u8166  \u945 \u7984 \u8182 \u957 \u959 \u962 \'b7 \u8165 \u940 \u946 \u948 \u959 \u962  \u949 \u8016 \u952 \u973 \u964 \u951 \u964 \u959 \u962  \u7969  \u8165 \u940 \u946 \u948 \u959 \u962  \u964 \u8134 \u962  \u946 \u945 \u963 \u953 \u955 \u949 \u943 \u945 \u962  \u963 \u959 \u965 . \u7968 \u947 \u940 \u960 \u951 \u963 \u945 \u962  \u948 \u953 \u954 \u945 \u953 \u959 \u963 \u973 \u957 \u951 \u957  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u7952 \u956 \u943 \u963 \u951 \u963 \u945 \u962  \u7936 \u957 \u959 \u956 \u943 \u945 \u957 \'b7 \u948 \u953 \u8048  \u964 \u959 \u8166 \u964 \u959  \u7956 \u967 \u961 \u953 \u963 \u941 \u957  \u963 \u949 , \u8001  \u920 \u949 \u972 \u962 , \u8001  \u920 \u949 \u972 \u962  \u963 \u959 \u965 , \u7956 \u955 \u945 \u953 \u959 \u957  \u7936 \u947 \u945 \u955 \u955 \u953 \u940 \u963 \u949 \u969 \u962  \u960 \u945 \u961 \u8048  \u964 \u959 \u8058 \u962  \u956 \u949 \u964 \u972 \u967 \u959 \u965 \u962  \u963 \u959 \u965 ."*\
