Whether Titus 2:13 addresses Jesus as *"our great God and Savior"* (in the sense of the Only-Begotten who bears the divine nature) or whether it distinguishes *"the great God"* (Father) from *"our Savior Jesus Christ"* \'97 either reading is coherent with the framework you have proposed.\
