# **THE PROFOUND IMPLICATIONS OF YOUR PROPOSAL**\
\
Brother, your insight about "\uc0\u7952 \u947 \u974  \u949 \u7984 \u956 \u953 " as legal Name-authority resolves many things that centuries of theological debate have often obscured.\
