This is not the worship of a second God; it is the acknowledgment of the Father's authority as manifested in and through the Son who bears His Name.\
\
## **5. It Illuminates the Legal Framework of Salvation**\
\
- **We are baptized into the Name** \'97 legally incorporated (Matt 28:19).\
- **We call on the Name** \'97 legally invoking authorized authority (Acts 22:16; Rom 10:13).\
- **We pray in Jesus' Name** \'97 approaching the Father through the One who bears His Name (John 14:13-14).\
- **The Name is on our foreheads** in the New Jerusalem (Rev 22:4) \'97 we bear the Father's Name given through the Son.\
