**\uc0\u7957 \u957 ** is the neuter of the numeral "one." Not the masculine **\u949 \u7991 \u962 ** (which would signify identity of person). The neuter **\u7957 \u957 ** signifies **oneness in a thing, a purpose, an operation** \'97 not identity of Person.\
