**\uc0\u8001  \u922 \u973 \u961 \u953 \u972 \u962  \u956 \u959 \u965  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u8001  \u920 \u949 \u972 \u962  \u956 \u959 \u965 ** \'97 both nouns have the article and the possessive *"my."*\
