## **5. We Are the Household and Family of God**\
\
Together, we are **the household of the Father** \'97 brothers and sisters, children of one Father, sharing one inheritance.\
\
### **Ephesians 3:14-15 (Greek):**\
*"...\uc0\u954 \u940 \u956 \u960 \u964 \u969  \u964 \u8048  \u947 \u972 \u957 \u945 \u964 \u940  \u956 \u959 \u965  \u960 \u961 \u8056 \u962  \u964 \u8056 \u957  \u928 \u945 \u964 \u941 \u961 \u945 , \u7952 \u958  \u959 \u8023  \u960 \u8118 \u963 \u945  \u960 \u945 \u964 \u961 \u953 \u8048  \u7952 \u957  \u959 \u8016 \u961 \u945 \u957 \u959 \u8150 \u962  \u954 \u945 \u8054  \u7952 \u960 \u8054  \u947 \u8134 \u962  \u8000 \u957 \u959 \u956 \u940 \u950 \u949 \u964 \u945 \u953 ,"*\
\
### **1599 Geneva:**\
*"I bow my knees unto the Father of our Lord Jesus Christ, Of whom is named the whole family in heaven and in earth,"*\
\
**One family \'97 in heaven and on earth.** The saints who have gone before, the believers alive now, all part of one family bearing the Father's Name.\
\
**Corporately, this means:**\
\
- **We are siblings** \'97 brothers and sisters in Christ.\
- **We share one Father** \'97 the same God who is the God of our Lord Jesus Christ (Eph 1:17).\
- **We share one Elder Brother** \'97 the Firstborn among many brethren (Rom 8:29; Heb 2:11-12).\
- **We share one inheritance** \'97 joint-heirs with Christ (Rom 8:17).\
- **We share one destiny** \'97 to dwell together forever in the Father's house.\
\
**We ought to love one another as family** (John 13:34-35; 1 Pet 1:22). This love is the mark by which the world knows we are His disciples.\
