**We are ambassadors** \'97 official representatives of the Father's kingdom, bearing the message of reconciliation from the King to a rebellious world.\
\
**Corporately, this means:**\
\
- **The Great Commission is our shared task** (Matt 28:19-20). Every believer, in his place, contributes.\
- **The Gospel is our shared message** \'97 the good news of reconciliation through the Son.\
- **The world is our shared field** \'97 all nations, tongues, and peoples.\
